# Nix artifacts
#
# Templates ship unlocked by default so a consumer resolves current nixpkgs on
# first use. The three re-included below are slow or fragile to resolve and are
# pinned deliberately — CLAUDE.md 5. Adding a locked template means adding a
# negation line here, and the lock-policy check enforces that it agrees with
# `locked` in meta/templates.nix.
flake.lock
!/flake.lock
!/android-kotlin/flake.lock
!/cpp-jetson/flake.lock
!/python-jetson/flake.lock

result
result-*
.direnv/

.claude/settings.local.json
